WEBVTT

00:01.455 --> 00:04.455
[kooky music]
[古怪的音乐]

00:04.455 --> 00:11.022
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:11.022 --> 00:14.889
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

00:14.889 --> 00:16.855
[alarm rings]
[警报响起]

00:16.855 --> 00:17.789
[ringing stops]
[铃声停止]

00:18.989 --> 00:21.622
- IT'S QUITTING TIME,
SPONGEBOB.
- 下班时间到了，
海绵宝宝。

00:21.622 --> 00:22.722
GO HOME.
回家吧。

00:22.722 --> 00:23.755
- HMM.
- 唔。

00:23.755 --> 00:25.722
- QUIT-TING TIME!
- 戒烟时间到了！

00:25.722 --> 00:27.989
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

00:27.989 --> 00:32.755
- GO HOME!
- 回家吧！

00:32.755 --> 00:33.989
[watch beeps]
[注意蜂鸣声]

00:33.989 --> 00:35.722
- OH, MY.
IT'S TIME TO GO HOME.
- 哦，我的。
是时候回家了。

00:35.722 --> 00:39.622
SQUIDWARD,
WHAT ARE YOU STILL DOING HERE?
章鱼哥，
你还在这里做什么？

00:39.622 --> 00:44.255
- [frustrated scream]
- [沮丧的尖叫声]

00:44.255 --> 00:46.322
- WHAT AM I GOING TO DO
WITH YOU?
- 我要做什么
和你在一起吗？

00:46.322 --> 00:49.055
I CAN'T THROW YOU AWAY.
我不能把你扔掉。

00:49.055 --> 00:50.989
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

00:52.989 --> 00:53.989
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

00:53.989 --> 00:55.555
BLEH!
哎呀！

00:55.555 --> 00:56.889
[flies buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡声]

00:56.889 --> 00:58.989
BUT I DO HAVE TO THROW AWAY
THE TRASH.
但我必须扔掉
垃圾。

01:00.755 --> 01:03.855
[loud breathing]
[大声呼吸]

01:07.422 --> 01:09.555
WHAT'S THIS?
这是什么？

01:09.555 --> 01:11.322
SOMEONE THREW AWAY A BOOK.
有人扔掉了一本书。

01:11.322 --> 01:13.989
YOU SHOULDN'T
THROW AWAY BOOKS.
你不应该
扔掉书籍。

01:13.989 --> 01:16.589
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:16.589 --> 01:17.689
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:17.689 --> 01:20.355
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:21.622 --> 01:22.622
- [teeth chattering]
- [牙齿打颤]

01:22.622 --> 01:23.555
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:26.622 --> 01:30.255
OH, SANDY?
YOU'RE A TRASH MONSTER?
哦，桑迪？
你是垃圾怪物吗？

01:30.255 --> 01:31.289
- HECK, NO.
- 哎呀，不。

01:31.289 --> 01:32.589
I WAS BREAKING A RECORD
我打破了记录

01:32.589 --> 01:34.322
FOR ROOTING AROUND
IN A TRASH BIN.
为了扎根周围
在垃圾桶里。

01:34.322 --> 01:35.889
IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE
一切都在这里

01:35.889 --> 01:38.155
IN THE GUINNESS O'RIPLEY
ENORMOUS BOOK
在吉尼斯奥里普利
大书

01:38.155 --> 01:41.389
OF CURIOSITIES, ODDITIES,
AND WORLD RECORDS.
好奇心、怪事、
和世界纪录。

01:41.389 --> 01:42.989
LOOKEE HERE, SPONGEBOB.
看这里，海绵宝宝。

01:42.989 --> 01:45.489
"STARING RECORD: FIVE DAYS."
“凝视记录：五天。”

01:45.489 --> 01:47.555
"MOST FRIES UP NOSE,
“大多数炸鼻子，

01:47.555 --> 01:48.655
HOLDING YOUR BREATH."
屏住呼吸。”

01:48.655 --> 01:51.722
- WOW.
- YES, SIREE.
- 哇。
- 是的，西莉。

01:51.722 --> 01:54.755
I SWEAR
BY THE POWER OF TEXAS,
我发誓
凭借德克萨斯州的力量，

01:54.755 --> 02:00.355
I'M GOING TO BREAK ALL
THE RECORDS IN THIS HERE BOOK!
我要打破一切
这本书里的记录！

02:00.355 --> 02:01.989
WHAT'S THE NEXT CHALLENGE?
下一个挑战是什么？

02:01.989 --> 02:03.622
- LET ME SEE.
OOH.
- 让我看看。
哦。

02:03.622 --> 02:05.655
"WORLD'S LONGEST TONGUE."
“世界上最长的舌头。”

02:05.655 --> 02:06.655
- WELL, THAT'S EASY.
- 嗯，这很简单。

02:06.655 --> 02:10.989
[stretching sounds]
[伸展声]

02:10.989 --> 02:14.189
106, 107...
106、107...
106、107...
106、107……
106、107...
106、107……
106、107……
106、107……

02:14.189 --> 02:17.522
- HOLD TIGHT, SANDY.
[grunts]
- 坚持住，桑迪。
[咕哝]

02:17.522 --> 02:22.189
- 108, 109, 110.
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。
- 108、109、110。

02:22.189 --> 02:23.655
- THAT'S IT, SANDY.
YOU DID IT.
- 就是这样，桑迪。
你做到了。

02:23.655 --> 02:25.555
- YEEHAW!
- 耶哈！

02:25.555 --> 02:26.655
[thud]
[砰]

02:30.289 --> 02:32.422
- LET'S SEE--YIKES!
- 让我们看看——哎呀！

02:32.422 --> 02:33.822
SWEET MOTHER OF PEARL.
甜美的珍珠母贝。

02:33.822 --> 02:36.522
- IS IT DANGEROUS?
- 危险吗？

02:36.522 --> 02:38.155
- YEAH, YOU COULD SAY THAT.
- 是的，你可以这么说。

02:38.155 --> 02:40.789
YOU HAVE TO EAT AS MUCH CHUM
AS YOU CAN.
你必须吃尽可能多的密友
尽你所能。

02:40.789 --> 02:42.822
- CHUM, HUH?
THAT'S NOT TOO BAD.
- 密友，嗯？
这还不错。

02:42.822 --> 02:43.889
- RAW.
- 生的。

02:43.889 --> 02:45.989
- RAW?
[gulps]
- 生的？
[吞咽]

02:47.889 --> 02:49.389
- YOU WANT WHAT?
- 你想要什么？

02:49.389 --> 02:51.689
- ONE ORDER OF CHUM PLEASE.
- RAW.
- 请点一份密友。
- 生的。

02:51.689 --> 02:55.455
- LOOK, I KNOW I'M AN EVIL,
HEARTLESS MASTERMIND,
- 看，我知道我是一个邪恶的人，
无情的主谋，

02:55.455 --> 02:58.655
BUT NO ONE CAN INGEST RAW CHUM
AND SURVIVE.
但没有人可以摄入生鱼片
并生存下来。

02:58.655 --> 03:00.022
- OH, YEAH?
- 哦，是吗？

03:00.022 --> 03:02.255
WELL, CHARLIE MACKEREL,
THE CURRENT RECORD HOLDER DID.
嗯，查理鲭鱼，
当前的记录保持者做到了。

03:02.255 --> 03:03.489
- REALLY?
- 真的吗？

03:03.489 --> 03:04.855
- FOR 30 SECONDS.
- 30 秒。

03:04.855 --> 03:07.989
- WELL, IT'S YOUR FUNERAL.
- 好吧，这是你的葬礼。

03:07.989 --> 03:10.989
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

03:13.622 --> 03:15.122
- OKAY, SANDY.
EAT UP.
- 好吧，桑迪。
吃吧。

03:15.122 --> 03:17.622
[chum wheezes]
[喘息声]

03:17.622 --> 03:21.155
- UH, SPONGEBOB,
I'VE CHANGED MY--
- 呃，海绵宝宝，
我改变了我的——

03:21.155 --> 03:22.689
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:22.689 --> 03:23.789
[gulps]
[吞咽]

03:23.789 --> 03:28.122
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:28.122 --> 03:29.622
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:29.622 --> 03:31.622
[monstrous grunting]
[可怕的咕噜声]

03:31.622 --> 03:33.789
WORLD! RECORD!
世界！记录！

03:33.789 --> 03:34.889
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

03:34.889 --> 03:37.389
- SANDY, YOU DID IT.
YOU SURVIVED.
- 桑迪，你做到了。
你活了下来。

03:37.389 --> 03:38.455
- AH!
- 啊！

03:38.455 --> 03:42.089
- UH-OH.
HOLD ON, SANDY.
- 呃-哦。
坚持住，桑迪。

03:42.089 --> 03:44.289
I KNOW JUST WHAT YOU NEED.
我知道您需要什么。

03:44.289 --> 03:47.122
[inhales]
[吸气]

03:47.122 --> 03:48.822
A KRABBY PATTY.
蟹肉饼。

03:48.822 --> 03:49.789
[bell dings]
[铃声]

03:51.989 --> 03:54.989
[rooster crows]
- [coughs, gasps]
[公鸡打鸣]
- [咳嗽、喘气]

03:54.989 --> 03:58.655
I DID IT!
I'M ALIVE.
我做到了！
我还活着。

03:58.655 --> 04:00.855
I CAN'T WAIT
TO SHOW THEM EXPERTS
我等不及了
向他们展示专家

04:00.855 --> 04:03.055
THE PICTURES
OF MY RECORD-BREAKING FEATS.
图片
我的破纪录壮举。

04:03.055 --> 04:04.822
- OH, NO.
I FORGOT MY CAMERA.
- 哦，不。
我忘记带相机了。

04:04.822 --> 04:06.455
- WHAT?
SPONGEBOB!
- 什么？
海绵宝宝！

04:06.455 --> 04:09.689
I NEED PHOTOGRAPHIC PROOF
OF MY AMAZING DEEDS.
我需要照片证明
我的惊人事迹。

04:09.689 --> 04:10.989
- I'LL GO GET THE CAMERA.
- 我去拿相机。

04:10.989 --> 04:14.255
- WELL, HURRY UP.
I'VE GOT RECORD-BREAKING TO DO.
- 好吧，快点。
我有打破纪录的任务要做。

04:17.422 --> 04:18.455
- OH, MY.
- 哦，我的。

04:18.455 --> 04:22.455
[robots beeping]
[机器人发出嘟嘟声]

04:22.455 --> 04:23.489
- GOT YOUR CAMERA?
- 你带相机了吗？

04:23.489 --> 04:25.522
- YOU BETCHA.
- 你猜对了。

04:25.522 --> 04:26.822
- GREAT.
- 伟大的。

04:26.822 --> 04:28.022
TAKE A PICTURE OF ME CHUCKING
THIS LAST WOODCHUCK
给我拍一张吃东西的照片
最后一只土拨鼠

04:28.022 --> 04:30.722
TO BREAK THE WOODCHUCK CHUCKING
WORLD RECORD.
打破土拨鼠的咀嚼
世界纪录。

04:30.722 --> 04:32.722
READY, COUSIN EARL?
准备好了吗，厄尔表弟？

04:32.722 --> 04:35.489
- LET HER RIP, DARLIN'!
- 让她撕裂吧，亲爱的！

04:35.489 --> 04:36.422
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:40.989 --> 04:43.822
- [robotic voice]
100 WOODCHUCKS CHUCKED.
- [机器人声音]
100 只土拨鼠被夹住。

04:43.822 --> 04:45.722
RECORD BROKEN.
记录被打破。

04:45.722 --> 04:47.122
- THANKS FOR ALL YOUR HELP,
COUSINS.
- 感谢您的帮助，
表兄弟。

04:47.122 --> 04:49.055
[chattering]
[喋喋不休]

04:49.055 --> 04:51.355
- ANYTIME.
- SEE YOU ALL NEXT CHRISTMAS.
- 随时。
- 下个圣诞节见。

04:51.355 --> 04:52.889
BYE.
再见。

04:53.989 --> 04:56.455
- WOW, SANDY.
WHAT IS ALL THIS?
- 哇，桑迪。
这是什么？

04:56.455 --> 04:58.989
- I'VE DECIDED TO GO ABOUT
THIS SCIENTIFICALLY.
- 我决定去
这是科学的。

04:58.989 --> 05:02.155
I FEEL WITH CAREFUL PLANNING
AND PRECISE DELEGATION
我觉得需要仔细计划
精准授权

05:02.155 --> 05:03.389
OF APPROPRIATE TASKS,
适当的任务，

05:03.389 --> 05:05.555
I CAN MANAGE
THE SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION
我能应付
圆满完成

05:05.555 --> 05:07.522
OF THE MAXIMUM NUMBER
OF RECORDS BROKEN
最大数量的
打破记录的数量

05:07.522 --> 05:08.989
IN THE LEAST AMOUNT OF TIME.
在最短的时间内。

05:08.989 --> 05:12.189
BOOK.
书。

05:12.189 --> 05:13.355
PICTURE.
图片。

05:13.355 --> 05:15.622
- HERE YOU GO.
- 干得好。

05:15.622 --> 05:18.422
- THANK YOU.
- 谢谢。

05:18.422 --> 05:19.489
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:19.489 --> 05:20.989
SO WHAT'S NEXT?
那么下一步是什么？

05:20.989 --> 05:22.789
OH, YEAH.
"LONGEST TOOTH."
哦，是的。
“最长的牙齿。”

05:22.789 --> 05:24.389
HOW'S THE CALCIUM INFUSION
GOING?
钙输液怎么样
去吗？

05:24.389 --> 05:27.289
IT IS READY, MS. CHEEKS.
准备好了，女士。脸颊。

05:27.289 --> 05:28.889
- OUTSTANDING.
- 杰出的。

05:28.889 --> 05:30.589
HERE. HOLD THIS.
这里。按住这个。

05:30.589 --> 05:32.222
[squirts]
[喷]

05:32.222 --> 05:34.355
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:38.189 --> 05:39.289
[thud]
[砰]

05:39.289 --> 05:41.889
HOW DID I DO?
我做得怎么样？

05:41.889 --> 05:46.689
- PLEASE HOLD THIS END.
- 请握住这一端。

05:46.689 --> 05:48.755
35 FEET.
35 英尺。

05:48.755 --> 05:50.422
RECORD BROKEN.
记录被打破。

05:50.422 --> 05:51.522
[thud]
[砰]

05:51.522 --> 05:52.855
- OUCH.
- 哎呀。

05:52.855 --> 05:54.622
[thud]
[砰]

05:54.622 --> 05:57.989
- TAKE A PICTURE.
- 拍张照片。

05:57.989 --> 05:59.289
- SAY, "CHEESE."
- 说，“奶酪。”

05:59.289 --> 06:00.389
- CHEESE.
- 奶酪。

06:00.389 --> 06:01.289
[camera shutter clicks]
[相机快门声]

06:06.222 --> 06:07.822
PICTURE.
- HERE YOU GO.
图片。
- 干得好。

06:07.822 --> 06:10.522
- THANK YOU.
- 谢谢。

06:10.522 --> 06:14.722
NEXT,
"SPICIEST CHILI GARGLE."
接下来，
“最辣的辣椒漱口水。”

06:14.722 --> 06:15.989
[chili bubbling]
[辣椒冒泡]

06:15.989 --> 06:17.989
[gulping]
[吞咽]

06:17.989 --> 06:22.155
[gargling]
[漱口]

06:22.155 --> 06:23.222
[gulps]
- GOT IT.
[吞咽]
- 明白了。

06:23.222 --> 06:24.189
YOU OKAY?
你还好吗？

06:24.189 --> 06:25.189
[stomach rumbling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

06:25.189 --> 06:26.122
[shouts]
[喊叫]

06:28.789 --> 06:29.789
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

06:29.789 --> 06:31.122
DO YOU SMELL SOUP?
你闻到汤味了吗？

06:31.122 --> 06:32.255
- WHAT'S NEXT?
- 下一步是什么？

06:32.255 --> 06:35.255
- "LARGEST RUBBER BAND BALL."
- “最大的橡皮筋球。”

06:35.255 --> 06:36.255
[camera shutter clicks]
[相机快门声]

06:36.255 --> 06:37.189
[rubber band snaps]
[橡皮筋按扣]

06:39.089 --> 06:41.655
- WHOO-HOO!
WHAT'S NEXT?
- 呼呼！
接下来是什么？

06:41.655 --> 06:43.755
- "MOST COBRAS MILKED."
- “大多数眼镜蛇都挤奶。”

06:43.755 --> 06:45.089
- [giggles]
SAY, "CHEESE."
- [咯咯笑]
说：“奶酪。”

06:45.089 --> 06:46.989
- CHEESE.
- 奶酪。

06:46.989 --> 06:48.722
- [gasps]
NICE SNAKES.
- [喘气]
不错的蛇。

06:48.722 --> 06:50.322
[choking]
[窒息]

06:50.322 --> 06:51.489
- NEXT?
- 下一个？

06:51.489 --> 06:54.355
- "MOST WALNUTS IN MOUTH."
- “嘴里最多的核桃。”

06:54.355 --> 06:58.122
- JUST ONE MORE.
- 再多一个。

06:58.122 --> 06:59.189
OH, NO.
哦，不。

06:59.189 --> 07:00.989
[shouts]
[喊叫]

07:00.989 --> 07:01.989
NEXT!
下一个！

07:01.989 --> 07:03.855
- "MOST CHAIN SAWS JUGGLED."
- “大多数链锯都是杂耍的。”

07:03.855 --> 07:09.122
[chain saws buzzing]
[电锯嗡嗡作响]

07:09.122 --> 07:11.422
- OKAY, SHOOT.
- 好吧，开枪。

07:11.422 --> 07:14.789
- GOT IT.
SO, UH, HOW DO YOU STOP?
- 知道了。
那么，呃，你怎么停下来？

07:14.789 --> 07:17.189
- WHAT?
- I SAID, "HOW DO YOU STOP?"
- 什么？
- 我说，“你怎么停下来？”

07:17.189 --> 07:19.455
- WHAT?
- HOW DO YOU STOP?
- 什么？
- 你怎么停下来？

07:19.455 --> 07:21.822
- WHY, THAT'S EASY.
I JUST...
- 为什么，这很简单。
我只是...

07:21.822 --> 07:23.289
[grunts]
STOP.
[咕哝]
停止。

07:23.289 --> 07:24.422
THEN RUN LIKE HECK.
然后狂奔。

07:24.422 --> 07:29.522
NOT THAT WAY.
不是那样的。

07:29.522 --> 07:32.555
COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
PULL YOURSELF TOGETHER.
来吧，海绵宝宝。
振作起来。

07:32.555 --> 07:34.389
WE'VE STILL GOT
A TON OF RECORDS TO BREAK.
我们还有
大量记录有待打破。

07:34.389 --> 07:38.155
OH, YEAH.
YOU'RE GOING TO LOVE THIS ONE.
哦，是的。
您一定会喜欢这个。

07:38.155 --> 07:39.222
- I DON'T KNOW, SANDY.
- 我不知道，桑迪。

07:39.222 --> 07:40.555
THIS IS GETTING
KIND OF DANGEROUS.
这正在得到
有点危险。

07:40.555 --> 07:42.655
- COME ON,
YOU DON'T NEED YOUR HELMET.
- 来吧，
您不需要头盔。

07:42.655 --> 07:45.689
THIS ONE'S OUTSIDE.
FOLLOW ME.
这个在外面。
跟我来。

07:45.689 --> 07:48.389
- OH, MY.
- THERE IT IS.
- 哦，我的。
- 就在那里。

07:48.389 --> 07:50.989
THE WORLD'S LARGEST HOUSE
OF CARDS.
世界上最大的房子
卡片。

07:50.989 --> 07:52.022
- THAT'S AMAZING.
- 太棒了。

07:52.022 --> 07:53.389
GET IN FRONT
SO I CAN TAKE A PICTURE.
走在前面
这样我就可以拍照了。

07:53.389 --> 07:55.555
- NAH. LET'S GET A SHOT
FROM THE TOP.
- 不。让我们来尝试一下
从顶部。

07:55.555 --> 07:58.589
[elevator bell dings]
[电梯铃声]

08:01.722 --> 08:03.789
- WHAT THE--?
- 什么--？

08:03.789 --> 08:05.455
OH, HEY.
哦，嘿。

08:05.455 --> 08:07.189
IT'S SOLITAIRE.
这是纸牌。

08:07.189 --> 08:10.355
I LOVE THIS GAME!
[laughs]
我喜欢这个游戏！
[笑]

08:10.355 --> 08:13.222
HEY, I KICK A TOUCHDOWN!
嘿，我触地得分！

08:13.222 --> 08:17.922
[cards jingling]
[卡片叮当作响]

08:17.922 --> 08:19.489
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

08:21.255 --> 08:22.822
- WHAT'S NEXT?
- 下一步是什么？

08:22.822 --> 08:24.989
- UM, I THINK I SMELL
GARY'S SANDBOX.
- 嗯，我想我闻到了
加里的沙盒。

08:24.989 --> 08:26.189
GOT TO GO CLEAN IT.
必须去清理它。

08:26.189 --> 08:27.289
NOW.
现在。

08:28.489 --> 08:31.822
I THINK YOU BROKE A RECORD
TODAY, GARY.
我认为你打破了记录
今天，加里。

08:31.822 --> 08:34.389
WORLD'S STINKIEST LITTER BOX.
EWW.
世界上最臭的垃圾箱。
EWW。

08:34.389 --> 08:35.455
OOH.
哦。

08:35.455 --> 08:37.322
I'M WORRIED ABOUT SANDY.
我很担心桑迪。

08:37.322 --> 08:39.389
SHE'S GOT
RECORD-BREAKING FEVER.
她有
破纪录的狂热。

08:39.389 --> 08:40.522
[Gary meows]
[加里喵喵声]

08:40.522 --> 08:42.089
YOU'RE RIGHT.
SHE DOES NEED MY HELP.
你说得对。
她确实需要我的帮助。

08:42.089 --> 08:43.722
I MUST STOP THIS MADNESS!
我必须阻止这种疯狂！

08:43.722 --> 08:45.589
IT'S ALL THAT BOOK'S FAULT.
都是那本书的错。

08:45.589 --> 08:47.122
THE BOOK IS EVIL.
这本书是邪恶的。

08:47.122 --> 08:50.055
THE BOOK MUST BE DESTROYED!
这本书必须被毁掉！

08:56.422 --> 08:57.555
[electricity crackles]
[电流爆裂声]

08:57.555 --> 08:59.422
[robot beeping]
[机器人嘟嘟声]

09:00.855 --> 09:03.489
[robotic voice]
WHY DON'T YOU TAKE FIVE?
[机器人声音]
你为什么不拿五个呢？

09:03.489 --> 09:05.022
I WILL HOLD THE BOOK.
我会拿着这本书。

09:05.022 --> 09:06.955
- THANK NEPTUNE'S GEARS.
- 感谢海王星的齿轮。

09:06.955 --> 09:10.522
MY WHEELS ARE KILLING ME.
我的车轮快要死了。

09:10.522 --> 09:12.989
- HEY! WHERE DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE GOING?
- 嘿！你认为在哪里
你要去吗？

09:12.989 --> 09:14.422
GET BACK IN LINE.
重新排队。

09:14.422 --> 09:16.489
I NEED EVERY AVAILABLE ROBOT
FOR THIS ONE.
我需要每一个可用的机器人
对于这个。

09:16.489 --> 09:19.355
MOST ROBOTS BUILT
AND DESTROYED IN A DAY.
建造最多的机器人
一天之内就被摧毁了。

09:19.355 --> 09:21.322
[crushing sounds]
[破碎的声音]

09:21.322 --> 09:23.822
- 656.
- 656。
- 656。
- 656。
- 656。
- 656。
- 656。
- 656。

09:23.822 --> 09:26.989
[crushing sounds]
657.
[破碎的声音]
657.

09:26.989 --> 09:30.522
OH, THE ARTIFICIAL HUMANITY.
哦，人造人类。

09:32.489 --> 09:34.455
- OH,
NO, YOU DON'T.
- 哦，
不，你不。

09:34.455 --> 09:37.022
WE'RE ALL IN THIS TOGETHER.
我们都在一起。

09:37.022 --> 09:38.522
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:45.889 --> 09:47.089
[bell dings]
[铃声]

09:47.089 --> 09:51.389
- 679. RECORD BROKEN.
- [squealing]
- 679. 记录被打破。
- [尖叫声]

09:51.389 --> 09:52.489
[bell dings]
[铃声]

09:52.489 --> 09:54.455
OKAY. SHUT HER DOWN.
好的。让她闭嘴。

09:54.455 --> 09:56.755
- OH, MY--
- WHAT'S WRONG WITH YOU?
- 哦，我的--
- 你怎么了？

09:56.755 --> 10:00.989
- MY STOMACH FEELS FUNNY.
- WELL, LET'S HAVE A LOOK.
- 我的胃感觉很奇怪。
- 好吧，让我们看看。

10:00.989 --> 10:02.989
SPONGEBOB?
- OH, HI, SANDY.
海绵宝宝？
- 哦，嗨，桑迪。

10:02.989 --> 10:04.722
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:04.722 --> 10:06.289
- SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

10:06.289 --> 10:08.722
- I'M HERE TO SAVE YOU
FROM--FROM THIS BOOK.
- 我是来救你的
来自——来自这本书。

10:08.722 --> 10:12.122
I'M GOING TO DESTROY IT
BEFORE SOMEONE GETS KILLED.
我要毁掉它
在有人被杀之前。

10:12.122 --> 10:14.622
I DON'T WANT
TO LOSE YOU, SANDY.
我不想要
失去你，桑迪。

10:14.622 --> 10:16.255
[crying]
I DON'T WANT TO LOSE YOU!
[哭泣]
我不想失去你！

10:16.255 --> 10:19.022
- OH, DON'T BE SILLY, SPONGEBOB.
I'M DONE WITH THAT BOOK.
- 哦，别傻了，海绵宝宝。
我已经看完那本书了。

10:19.022 --> 10:21.155
I BEAT EVERY RECORD IN HERE.
我打破了这里的每一项记录。

10:21.155 --> 10:23.689
IN FACT, I'VE INVITED
THE AUTHOR TO VERIFY
事实上，我已经邀请了
作者要验证

10:23.689 --> 10:24.689
MY EMINENCE.
陛下。

10:24.689 --> 10:26.822
- THANK YOU.
HMM.
- 谢谢。
唔。

10:26.822 --> 10:29.222
YES. OH, MY.
是的。哦，我的。

10:29.222 --> 10:31.555
I SEE.
WELL, THEN.
我懂了。
好吧，那么。

10:31.555 --> 10:34.522
I'M AFRAID YOU'VE BROKEN
NO RECORDS.
我担心你已经崩溃了
没有记录。

10:34.522 --> 10:37.522
both: HUH?
- THIS BOOK IS 30 YEARS OLD.
两人：嗯？
- 这本书已经有 30 年历史了。

10:37.522 --> 10:39.989
THESE RECORDS
WERE BROKEN AGES AGO.
这些记录
很久以前就已经破碎了。

10:39.989 --> 10:43.255
YOU, HOWEVER, HAVE SET
A BRAND-NEW RECORD.
然而，你已经设定了
全新记录。

10:43.255 --> 10:47.689
MOST INJURIES SUSTAINED
WHILE HELPING A FRIEND.
大多数人受伤
在帮助朋友的同时。

10:47.689 --> 10:49.622
- GOOD FOR YOU, SPONGEBOB.
- 对你有好处，海绵宝宝。

10:49.622 --> 10:51.989
[shatters]
[破碎]

10:51.989 --> 10:54.255
- UM, HOORAY.
- 嗯，万岁。

10:54.255 --> 10:56.022
- SAY, "CHEESE."
[camera shutter clicks]
- 说，“奶酪。”
[相机快门声]

- 说，“奶酪。”
[相机快门声]